<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>오늘도 무사히 | 서예종 게임 기획 포트폴리오</title>
<style>:root{--ink:#204765;--ink-deep:#163b5d;--ink-muted:#617f95;--accent:#4b96d2;--accent-deep:#287abc;--sky:#dfF3ff;--sky-mid:#c1e5fa;--powder:#eef8ff;--white:#fff;--line:rgba(69,125,166,.15);--shadow:0 26px 70px rgba(42,117,170,.13);--rad:26px;--max:1190px}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:92px}body{margin:0;background:#f8fcff;color:var(--ink);font-family:Pretendard,'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Noto Sans KR',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;word-break:keep-all}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button{font:inherit}::selection{background:#adddf9;color:#174a72}.container{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 88px));margin-inline:auto}.skip-link{position:fixed;top:-100px;left:16px;background:white;padding:12px 18px;z-index:30}.skip-link:focus{top:10px}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #257ab9;outline-offset:4px}
.site-header{height:86px;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:10}.nav-shell{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;height:100%;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;flex-shrink:0}.brand-symbol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,5px);align-items:center;gap:3px;width:29px;height:30px;transform:rotate(-26deg)}.brand-symbol span{border-radius:6px;background:#67addc}.brand-symbol span:nth-child(1){height:15px}.brand-symbol span:nth-child(2){height:28px}.brand-symbol span:nth-child(3){height:19px;background:#a6d5ee}.brand-wordmark{display:block;font-weight:850;font-size:19px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.055em}.brand-dot{color:#59b8e5}.brand-wordmark small{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:8px;color:#5c8dae;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em}.desktop-nav{display:flex;gap:37px;margin-left:auto}.desktop-nav a{font-size:13px;font-weight:750;color:#477394;transition:color .2s}.desktop-nav a:hover,.desktop-nav a.is-active{color:#1c6297}.nav-contact{font-weight:750;background:rgba(255,255,255,.65);padding:12px 20px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.93);border-radius:999px;display:flex;gap:23px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px #9ccce223}.nav-contact:hover{background:white}.nav-contact span{font-size:19px;line-height:1}.mobile-toggle,.mobile-menu{display:none}
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:840px;background:linear-gradient(116deg,#e8f6ff 0%,#b8dff7 54%,#eaf9ff 100%);isolation:isolate}.sky-wash{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 500px 510px at 93% 29%,#ffffffcf,transparent 82%),radial-gradient(ellipse 560px 520px at 17% -7%,#ffffffa6,transparent 80%),radial-gradient(ellipse 650px 260px at 35% 98%,#effaffaa,transparent 86%)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.04fr .96fr;align-items:center;gap:18px;position:relative;min-height:840px;padding-top:76px;padding-bottom:64px}.hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;margin-top:-28px}.hero-eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#2f84b3;margin-bottom:32px}.status-star{font-size:23px;line-height:1;color:#56a5d6}.eyebrow-line{width:36px;height:1px;background:#72b5dd}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(45px,4.6vw,69px);letter-spacing:-.079em;line-height:1.25;font-weight:850;color:#16466b;margin:0 0 25px}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#4491c8}.title-period{color:#75b9dc}.hero-intro{font-size:16px;line-height:1.95;color:#517995;letter-spacing:-.03em}.hero-intro strong{color:#2c668e}.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin-top:39px}.primary-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:39px;background:#337eb5;border-radius:999px;color:white;padding:19px 23px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 23px #448fc045;transition:transform .2s,background .2s,box-shadow .2s}.primary-button:hover{background:#1f699f;transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 25px #448fc04d}.primary-button span{font-size:19px;line-height:.8}.text-button{font-size:13px;font-weight:750;color:#386d91;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.text-button span{font-size:19px}.text-button:hover{color:#174d7a}.draft-marker{margin-top:96px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:#6f9dbb;font-size:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.12em}.draft-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#81bdcf}.cloud,.contact-cloud{position:absolute;width:180px;height:48px;background:#ffffffe0;border-radius:60px;filter:blur(1px)}.cloud:before,.cloud:after,.contact-cloud:before,.contact-cloud:after{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:inherit}.cloud:before,.contact-cloud:before{width:84px;height:84px;left:33px;bottom:10px}.cloud:after,.contact-cloud:after{width:61px;height:61px;right:23px;bottom:8px}.cloud-one{left:-50px;top:240px;opacity:.51;transform:scale(.8)}.cloud-two{right:6%;top:127px;opacity:.37;transform:scale(.82)}.cloud-three{left:36%;bottom:145px;opacity:.35;transform:scale(1.35)}.hero-art{height:624px;position:relative;transform:translateX(12px);min-width:0}.sun-halo{position:absolute;width:480px;height:480px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#f5fdffc9 0%,#fafcff55 55%,#fff0 70%);left:53%;top:40%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.hero-orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid #ffffffac;border-radius:50%;width:540px;height:540px;left:53%;top:43%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.orbit-two{width:425px;height:425px;border-style:dashed;border-color:#ffffff77}.art-cloud{position:absolute;width:100px;height:29px;border-radius:70px;background:#fff9;z-index:1}.art-cloud::before{content:"";position:absolute;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;left:19px;bottom:9px;background:inherit}.art-cloud-one{top:90px;right:12px;transform:rotate(-10deg)}.art-cloud-two{bottom:159px;left:0;transform:scale(.8) rotate(8deg)}.floating-star{position:absolute;z-index:4;color:#fff;filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 9px #79afd9);font-size:31px;animation:float 6s ease-in-out infinite}.star-one{top:96px;left:90px}.star-two{right:-2px;top:198px;font-size:45px}.star-three{bottom:130px;right:52px;font-size:23px;color:#fff4ca}.idea-window{width:min(430px,calc(100% - 18px));position:absolute;z-index:3;left:52%;top:44%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-5deg);background:#fffd;border:1px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 40px 90px #4489b73c,0 5px 9px #3681ab19;border-radius:23px;overflow:hidden;backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}.window-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:17px 21px;border-bottom:1px solid #e1f1fb;background:#f5fbff;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.11em;color:#7093ac;font-weight:850}.window-dots{display:flex;gap:5px}.window-dots i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#fad5c6}.window-dots i:nth-child(2){background:#ffe1ab}.window-dots i:nth-child(3){background:#c5e7cb}.window-smile{font-size:18px;line-height:0;color:#68b4d8}.board-content{height:350px;position:relative;padding:35px 42px 15px}.board-kicker{font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#81b6d2}.board-title{font-size:47px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.08em;line-height:1.07;color:#2b5d86;margin-top:12px}.board-title span{color:#64afe0}.board-diagram{width:100%;height:160px;display:block;margin-top:0;overflow:visible}.floating-sticker{position:absolute;z-index:5;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 40px #4694c53b}.sticker-left{left:7px;top:178px;border-radius:17px;padding:16px 17px;color:#4f90ba;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.09em;transform:rotate(10deg);line-height:1.3}.sticker-left span{display:block;font-size:33px;color:#96cae5;line-height:1}.sticker-right{right:-22px;bottom:142px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:13px 19px;border-radius:15px;transform:rotate(7deg)}.sticker-icon{font-size:36px;color:#f5c472}.sticker-right b{font-size:12px;display:block;color:#397bb0}.sticker-right small{font-size:9px;color:#8db0c6;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em}.hero-landscape{position:absolute;inset:auto -40px 0 -40px;height:160px;overflow:hidden;z-index:0;opacity:.75}.hill{position:absolute;bottom:-135px;width:630px;height:250px;border-radius:50%}.hill-back{background:#b6ded0;left:6%;transform:rotate(-8deg)}.hill-front{background:#a8d9bc;left:-33%;bottom:-165px;transform:rotate(6deg)}.tiny-flower{position:absolute;z-index:2;color:#fff5dd;font-size:18px}.flower-one{bottom:40px;left:30%}.flower-two{bottom:57px;right:7%}.flower-three{bottom:25px;right:28%}.hero-bottom-cloud{position:absolute;bottom:-70px;left:-3%;width:110%;height:108px;background:#f8fcff;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;transform:rotate(-1.2deg)}.scroll-note{position:absolute;bottom:61px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:2;font-size:9px;color:#558bb0;letter-spacing:.19em;font-weight:850;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.scroll-note span{font-size:18px}
.section{padding:129px 0}.section-index{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:900;color:#5c9ecb}.section-heading{font-size:clamp(33px,3.5vw,49px);line-height:1.35;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.064em;margin:17px 0 24px;color:#254f70}.section-heading span{color:#6aaed8}.section-lead{color:#738fa3;font-size:16px;line-height:1.98;max-width:715px;margin:0}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22% 1fr;gap:55px}.section-side{position:relative;padding-top:17px}.deco-sparkle{font-size:85px;color:#d9effd;margin-top:55px;transform:rotate(18deg);line-height:1}.section-heading-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mini-pill{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#669fc4;background:#eff8ff;padding:9px 17px;border-radius:40px;letter-spacing:.11em}.soft-star{font-size:35px;color:#b2dff5;margin-right:7px}.about-tag-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:30px 0 48px}.about-tag-row span{padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #cde7f8;border-radius:999px;color:#5f91b2;background:#f7fcff;font-weight:750;font-size:12px}.quote-block{background:linear-gradient(107deg,#eff9ff,#fff 84%);border:1px solid #dbedf8;border-radius:22px;padding:32px 38px;max-width:770px;position:relative;box-shadow:0 18px 35px #4f95c00a}.quote-icon{font-size:57px;line-height:.8;color:#91c5e3;font-family:Georgia,serif}.quote-block p{font-size:21px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:4px 0 23px}.quote-foot{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#90b2c8}
.focus-section{background:#edf8ff;position:relative}.focus-section:before{position:absolute;content:"";top:-25px;left:-3%;width:110%;height:44px;background:#edf8ff;border-radius:50%}.section-title-group{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:35px;margin-bottom:45px}.section-title-group .section-heading{margin-bottom:0}.section-title-group>p{color:#7b9ab0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;margin:0 0 4px}.focus-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:19px}.focus-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e1eff8;border-radius:25px;padding:30px 30px 28px;box-shadow:0 22px 48px #5c9bc016;transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s;min-height:330px}.focus-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:0 28px 50px #5c9bc029}.focus-icon{width:90px;height:90px;border-radius:24px;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}.focus-icon svg{width:65px;height:65px}.focus-blue{background:#e4f3ff;color:#62a4da}.focus-lilac{background:#f0edff;color:#9790d9}.focus-peach{background:#fff1e3;color:#dcaa81}.card-number{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#8aaec3;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:900}.focus-card h3{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:11px 0 10px}.focus-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#7793a7;margin:0 0 21px;min-height:72px}.tag-chip{display:inline-block;background:#f2f8fc;color:#7798b2;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em}
.projects-section{background:#f8fcff}.project-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px}.project-card{min-width:0}.project-card.featured{grid-column:1/-1}.project-cover{height:270px;border-radius:23px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}.featured .project-cover{height:390px}.cover-one{background:linear-gradient(125deg,#a4ccef 5%,#cfe7ff 48%,#eaf7ff 100%)}.cover-one:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:600px;height:600px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#fff9,transparent 70%);right:-60px;top:-155px}.cover-sun{position:absolute;width:178px;height:178px;background:#f8f8e7;border-radius:50%;top:61px;right:17%;box-shadow:0 0 80px 32px #fffbf0ab}.cover-ring{position:absolute;width:380px;height:380px;right:9%;top:7px;border:1px solid #ffffffa9;border-radius:50%}.ring-b{transform:scale(1.23);border-style:dashed;opacity:.65}.cover-copy{position:absolute;top:92px;left:9%;font-size:68px;letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:1.04;font-weight:850;color:#fff;z-index:2;text-shadow:0 3px 20px #4379a825}.cover-copy em{font-style:normal;color:#fff7d7}.cover-preview-chip{position:absolute;top:22px;left:25px;z-index:3;background:#fffafd;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 14px;color:#6e9bba;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em}.cover-cloud{position:absolute;right:8%;bottom:75px;width:200px;height:54px;border-radius:60px;background:#ffffffaa;transform:rotate(5deg)}.cover-cloud:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:100px;height:95px;left:30px;bottom:11px;border-radius:50%;background:inherit}.cover-hill{position:absolute;width:125%;height:240px;border-radius:50%;background:#a2d7c1;left:-20%;bottom:-200px;transform:rotate(-7deg)}.cover-two{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#e8e4ff,#ceddfd 67%,#c5e7f6)}.orbit-graphic{position:absolute;left:50%;top:51%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:220px;height:220px;display:grid;place-items:center}.orbit-graphic span{position:absolute;border:2px solid #fffafa;border-radius:50%}.orbit-large{inset:0}.orbit-mid{inset:34px;background:#e9f3ffb8;box-shadow:0 8px 35px #758dda25}.orbit-small{inset:69px;background:#fafaff;box-shadow:0 8px 35px #758dda25}.orbit-graphic b{font-size:42px;color:#8f9ddb;z-index:2;letter-spacing:-.09em}.cover-three{background:linear-gradient(125deg,#e2f6e9,#d7f1f9 70%,#effaf4)}.sketch-frame{position:absolute;width:195px;height:235px;background:#ffffffc9;border:1px solid #fff;box-shadow:12px 12px 0 #99d9c278,0 18px 60px #74b49c47;border-radius:12px;left:50%;top:55%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-7deg);padding:26px}.sketch-frame>span{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;color:#81b39c;letter-spacing:.12em}.sketch-line{height:5px;background:#b5dbd1;border-radius:4px;position:absolute;left:26px}.line-a{top:63px;width:104px}.line-b{top:78px;width:77px}.line-c{bottom:57px;width:125px}.line-d{bottom:42px;width:81px}.sketch-shape{position:absolute;top:111px;left:62px;width:64px;height:45px;background:#cae4f5;border-radius:14px 14px 26px 26px;transform:rotate(-14deg)}.cover-asterisk{position:absolute;right:9%;top:28%;color:white;font-size:62px}.project-info{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:end;padding:21px 7px 14px}.project-type{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#80a4bb}.project-info h3{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:9px 0 9px}.project-info p{font-size:13px;color:#809bad;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.coming-pill{border:1px solid #d5e8f5;border-radius:100px;color:#7b9db6;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:10px;padding:11px 13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#fff}.coming-pill span{font-size:13px;margin-left:9px}.project-footnote{margin-top:32px;text-align:center;color:#8faabd;font-size:12px}.project-footnote span{color:#75add2;margin-right:9px}
.process-section{background:linear-gradient(155deg,#eaf7ff,#f8fcff);position:relative}.process-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.83fr 1.17fr;gap:90px;align-items:start}.process-intro{padding-top:36px}.process-intro>p{color:#7796a9;line-height:1.9;max-width:360px;font-size:14px}.process-doodle{display:block;margin-top:65px;color:#a7d3ed;letter-spacing:.45em;font-size:25px}.process-steps{position:relative;border-radius:25px;background:#ffffffd4;border:1px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 22px 45px #7eb1d015;padding:16px 32px}.process-step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 1fr 34px;gap:15px;align-items:center;padding:24px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5f1f9;position:relative}.process-step:last-child{border:0}.process-number{color:#93bed9;font-size:14px;font-weight:900}.process-step h3{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 9px;color:#396987;letter-spacing:-.04em}.process-step h3 small{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;color:#95aec0;margin-left:13px}.process-step p{font-size:12px;margin:0;color:#8da5b4}.step-icon{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:19px;color:#73afda;background:#eef8ff}.process-step:nth-child(3) .step-icon{color:#9b95d9;background:#f3f1ff}.process-step:nth-child(4) .step-icon{color:#ccad60;background:#fff9e5}.process-step:nth-child(5) .step-icon{color:#6cae9c;background:#e7f8f2}
.contact-section{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#b8e0f7,#dcf3ff 66%,#f0faff);text-align:center;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;padding:107px 0 100px}.contact-section:after{position:absolute;inset:0;content:"";z-index:-1;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 530px 300px at 67% 0%,#fff8,transparent),radial-gradient(ellipse 400px 300px at 10% 92%,#fff7,transparent)}.contact-inner{position:relative}.contact-inner .section-index{color:#4c94bf}.contact-sparkle{font-size:41px;color:white;margin:24px 0 0;filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 7px #98cdec)}.contact-inner h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,60px);letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:1.38;color:#22597d;margin:15px 0 20px}.contact-inner h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#4b9acc}.contact-inner p{color:#6895b2;line-height:1.95;font-size:14px}.contact-footer-action{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-top:39px}.contact-placeholder{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#5a8cae;border:1px solid #ffffffa8;background:#ffffffaa;padding:15px 25px;border-radius:50px}.contact-top{font-weight:850;font-size:12px;color:#296f9e;border-bottom:1px solid #7ab5d5;padding:10px}.contact-top:hover{color:#064c7b}.contact-cloud{z-index:-1;opacity:.35}.cc-one{left:-62px;top:45%;transform:scale(1.5)}.cc-two{right:-34px;top:36%;transform:scale(1.2)}.site-footer{background:#f8fcff;padding:35px 0}.footer-grid{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}.footer-brand{font-size:20px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:#285d83}.footer-brand span{color:#69b4df}.footer-grid>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#93b1c3;font-weight:850}.footer-grid small{margin-left:auto;color:#9db3c1;font-size:11px}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .55s ease,transform .55s ease}.reveal.is-visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}.hero-art.reveal.is-visible{transform:translateX(12px)}@keyframes float{0%,100%{translate:0 0}50%{translate:0 -11px}}
@media(max-width:1050px){.container{width:min(var(--max),calc(100% - 56px))}.hero{min-height:770px}.hero-grid{min-height:770px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,4.7vw,55px)}.hero-art{transform:translateX(-5px) scale(.88);transform-origin:center}.hero-art.reveal.is-visible{transform:translateX(-5px) scale(.88)}.idea-window{width:415px}.sticker-right{right:-28px}.desktop-nav{gap:23px}.process-wrap{gap:40px}.cover-copy{font-size:59px}}
@media(max-width:760px){.container{width:calc(100% - 38px)}.site-header{height:72px}.nav-shell{border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff88}.brand-wordmark{font-size:18px}.desktop-nav,.nav-contact{display:none}.mobile-toggle{margin-left:auto;display:grid;place-content:center;gap:5px;width:44px;height:42px;border:1px solid #fff9;background:#ffffff8c;border-radius:13px;cursor:pointer}.mobile-toggle span{height:2px;width:20px;background:#376e96;border-radius:3px;transition:transform .2s,opacity .2s}.mobile-toggle[aria-expanded=true] span:first-child{transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg)}.mobile-toggle[aria-expanded=true] span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}.mobile-toggle[aria-expanded=true] span:last-child{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg)}.mobile-menu:not([hidden]){display:flex;position:absolute;left:19px;right:19px;top:70px;padding:10px;flex-direction:column;border-radius:18px;background:#ffffffed;box-shadow:0 20px 40px #4e9fc138;backdrop-filter:blur(15px)}.mobile-menu a{padding:12px 15px;font-size:14px;color:#3e779e;font-weight:750}.hero{min-height:auto}.hero-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:0;padding-top:150px;padding-bottom:85px;min-height:0}.hero-copy{margin:0}.hero-eyebrow{font-size:9px;margin-bottom:24px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,9vw,62px);line-height:1.28}.hero-intro{font-size:14px;margin-top:21px;line-height:1.9}.hero-actions{margin-top:28px;gap:19px}.primary-button{padding:16px 18px;gap:19px;font-size:12px}.text-button{font-size:11px}.draft-marker{margin-top:33px;font-size:9px}.hero-art{height:470px;max-width:540px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;transform:scale(.86) translateX(-2px);transform-origin:center center}.hero-art.reveal.is-visible{transform:scale(.86) translateX(-2px)}.hero-orbit{width:440px;height:440px;top:50%}.orbit-two{width:345px;height:345px}.sun-halo{width:390px;height:390px;top:51%}.idea-window{width:min(405px,100%);top:47%}.sticker-left{top:125px;left:-5px}.sticker-right{bottom:93px;right:-10px}.hero-landscape{bottom:-2px}.scroll-note{display:none}.section{padding:87px 0}.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}.section-side{padding-top:0}.deco-sparkle{display:none}.section-heading{font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,44px)}.section-lead{font-size:14px}.quote-block{padding:28px 25px}.quote-block p{font-size:17px}.focus-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.focus-card{min-height:auto;padding:25px}.focus-icon{width:70px;height:70px;margin-bottom:16px}.focus-icon svg{width:52px}.focus-card p{min-height:auto}.section-title-group{display:block}.section-title-group>p{margin-top:18px}.project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.project-card.featured{grid-column:auto}.project-cover,.featured .project-cover{height:260px}.cover-copy{font-size:43px;top:85px;left:8%}.cover-sun{width:135px;height:135px}.cover-ring{width:280px;height:280px}.project-info{align-items:start}.project-info h3{font-size:19px}.project-info p{font-size:12px}.coming-pill{font-size:9px;padding:9px}.process-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px}.process-intro{padding-top:0}.process-doodle{display:none}.process-steps{padding:10px 20px}.process-step h3{font-size:18px}.process-step h3 small{font-size:11px}.contact-section{padding:85px 0}.contact-inner h2{font-size:37px}.contact-footer-action{flex-direction:column}.footer-grid{flex-wrap:wrap}.footer-grid small{margin-left:0;width:100%}}
@media(max-width:400px){.hero-grid{padding-top:127px}.hero h1{font-size:39px}.hero-intro{font-size:13px}.hero-actions{gap:13px}.hero-art{height:420px;transform:scale(.78) translateX(-5px);margin-top:-6px}.hero-art.reveal.is-visible{transform:scale(.78) translateX(-5px)}.idea-window{width:400px;max-width:none}.hero-orbit{left:53%}.art-cloud-one{right:-85px}.sticker-right{right:-50px}.project-info{flex-direction:column}.coming-pill{margin-top:7px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}.reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}.hero-art.reveal{transform:none}}


/* ================================================================
   PORTFOLIO CONCEPT V2 — Refinements
   The original sky illustration and palette remain untouched.
   This section controls refinement and the interactive prototype.
   ================================================================ */
:root{--surface:#fff;--sky-edge:#badff5;--soft-lilac:#e4e4ff;--soft-mint:#e4f7ef}
html{scroll-padding-top:92px}
body{overflow-x:hidden}
button{font:inherit}
button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #277ec9;outline-offset:4px}
::selection{background:#b5e4ff;color:#16476f}
.scroll-progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px;z-index:110;pointer-events:none}
.scroll-progress>span{height:100%;width:0;display:block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5ab4ed,#89d5f6,#8fb9e8);box-shadow:0 1px 7px #7ccaffb5;transition:width .08s linear}
.site-header{position:fixed;top:3px;transition:background .3s,box-shadow .3s;backdrop-filter:blur(0)}
.site-header.is-scrolled{background:#eef9ffdf;box-shadow:0 6px 35px rgba(66,134,180,.09);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px)}
.site-header .nav-shell{transition:border-color .3s}
.site-header.is-scrolled .nav-shell{border-color:transparent}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(111deg,#ecf9ff 0%,#c5e6f9 46%,#ddf4ff 79%,#f3fbff 100%)}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 32% 38% at 78% 15%,#fff9,transparent 85%),radial-gradient(ellipse 42% 45% at 9% 65%,#fff6,transparent 80%)}
.hero .hero-intro{max-width:475px}
.hero .title-period{color:#88ccea}
.hero-eyebrow{letter-spacing:.16em}
.hero-eyebrow .status-star{filter:drop-shadow(0 3px 6px #8bc7e3)}
.idea-window{box-shadow:0 40px 95px #417baf35,0 6px 12px #307bad17;transition:box-shadow .35s ease}
.hero-art:hover .idea-window{box-shadow:0 47px 103px #417baf4a,0 6px 12px #307bad17}
.floating-sticker{animation:float 7s ease-in-out infinite}
.sticker-right{animation-delay:-3.1s}
.draft-marker{background:#f8fcff99;border:1px solid #ffffffa3;display:inline-flex;border-radius:99px;padding:9px 13px;box-shadow:0 6px 21px #6eb0ce15}
.sky-ribbon{background:#f8fcff;border-top:1px solid #eaf5fc;border-bottom:1px solid #e2f1fa;position:relative;z-index:2}
.sky-ribbon-inner{min-height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.ribbon-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:900;color:#7fa9c4}
.ribbon-words{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;font-size:23px;color:#487ca1;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.055em}
.ribbon-words span{display:inline-flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px}
.ribbon-words i{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:0;font-style:normal;color:#9dc9e3;margin-top:2px}
.ribbon-words b{color:#b7dbee;font-size:14px;font-weight:400}
.sky-ribbon a{text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.10em;color:#6f9dbc;border-bottom:1px solid #aacde2;padding-bottom:5px;white-space:nowrap}
.sky-ribbon a:hover{color:#217ab5}
.about-main .quote-block{border:1px solid #e7f2f9;box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(71,134,179,.055)}
.about-principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:38px;border-top:1px solid #dceef8;border-bottom:1px solid #dceef8}
.about-principles>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;padding:24px 17px 25px;border-right:1px solid #e3f0f8}
.about-principles>div:first-child{padding-left:5px}
.about-principles>div:last-child{border-right:0}
.about-principles span{font-size:10px;font-weight:950;color:#7ab8de;letter-spacing:.08em}
.about-principles strong{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.055em;color:#376d94}
.about-principles small{font-size:12px;color:#91a9b9;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.focus-card{border:1px solid #eaf4fb;transition:transform .3s ease,box-shadow .3s ease,border-color .3s ease;background:#fffe}
.focus-card:hover{transform:translateY(-9px);box-shadow:0 29px 60px #4f9ac026;border-color:#c7e6f8}
.focus-card .focus-icon{transition:transform .3s ease}
.focus-card:hover .focus-icon{transform:rotate(-5deg) scale(1.06)}
.project-cover{transition:filter .3s ease,transform .4s ease}
.project-card{border-radius:25px;transition:transform .33s ease}
.project-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}
.project-card:hover .project-cover{filter:saturate(1.06) brightness(1.01)}
.project-info{gap:20px}
.case-preview-btn{align-self:end;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;appearance:none;border:1px solid #a6d0ea;border-radius:100px;background:#f1f9ff;color:#2e77a8;cursor:pointer;font-weight:850;font-size:11px;display:flex;gap:17px;align-items:center;padding:12px 16px;transition:color .2s,background .2s,box-shadow .2s,transform .2s}
.case-preview-btn:hover{color:#fff;background:#388ec6;border-color:#388ec6;box-shadow:0 9px 24px #4c9ed04a;transform:translateY(-2px)}
.case-preview-btn span{font-size:15px}
.project-footnote{background:#f2faff;border:1px solid #dfedf7;border-radius:100px;padding:15px 20px;width:fit-content;margin:40px auto 0!important;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}
.project-footnote span{margin-right:7px}
.process-steps{position:relative}
.process-steps-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;color:#8baec2;letter-spacing:.11em;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;padding:15px 6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7f1f8}
.process-step{appearance:none;cursor:pointer;width:100%;background:transparent;text-align:left;transition:background .2s,padding .2s,border-color .2s;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #e7f1f8;display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 1fr 34px;gap:15px;align-items:center;padding:20px 5px;border-radius:0}
.process-step:hover{background:#f1f9ff}
.process-step.is-selected{background:#f0f9ff;border-left:3px solid #70b8e3;padding-left:12px}
.process-step-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.process-step-copy strong{font-size:21px;line-height:1.15;color:#376d92;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:-.045em}
.process-step-copy small{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#91abc0;font-weight:750;margin-left:12px}
.process-step-copy>span{font-size:12px;color:#8da5b4;line-height:1.55}
.process-step .step-icon{transition:transform .2s,background .2s}
.process-step.is-selected .step-icon{background:#d8eefc;transform:scale(1.08)}
.process-insight{margin-top:21px;padding:22px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#edf8ff,#f6fbff);border:1px solid #d7eafa;border-radius:17px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.process-insight:after{content:'✦';position:absolute;right:20px;top:14px;font-size:40px;color:#d5ecfa;pointer-events:none}
.process-insight>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;z-index:1}
.insight-label{font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#71accc;white-space:nowrap}
#insight-title{font-size:14px;color:#326e95;letter-spacing:-.03em}
#insight-body{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#668da8;margin:9px 0 11px;max-width:440px}
.insight-chips{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#4f93c1}
.contact-placeholder{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px #8cbddd24}
.contact-placeholder b{font-size:11px;color:#7ea9c7;font-weight:700}
.contact-bubble{display:grid;place-items:center;background:#e0f1fc;width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:50%;font-size:15px}
.contact-inner h2{max-width:780px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.back-to-top{position:fixed;bottom:28px;right:28px;width:48px;height:48px;border:1px solid #d6ebf8;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffffef;box-shadow:0 9px 25px #3a8fbb30;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#3984b9;font-size:22px;z-index:30;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:translateY(10px);transition:opacity .25s,transform .25s,background .2s}
.back-to-top.is-visible{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translateY(0)}
.back-to-top:hover{background:#dfF3ff}
/* Modal: intentionally shows only blank future case study layout */
.case-dialog{border:0;background:transparent;padding:16px;width:min(820px,calc(100% - 30px));max-height:min(90vh,1000px);margin:auto;overflow:auto;border-radius:28px;color:var(--ink);box-sizing:border-box}
.case-dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(23,61,90,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(7px)}
.dialog-shell{background:#fcfeff;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 100px #164d773b}
.dialog-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:13px 19px;background:white;color:#78a0b9;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:850}
.dialog-close{cursor:pointer;background:#eff8ff;border:0;border-radius:50%;width:36px;height:36px;color:#4b90bc;font-size:16px}
.dialog-hero{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(125deg,#c3e7fc,#dff4ff 55%,#f4fbff);padding:53px 53px 50px;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate}
.dialog-hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;width:270px;height:270px;right:2%;bottom:-150px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff9;filter:blur(8px)}
.dialog-rings{position:absolute;width:330px;height:330px;border:1px solid #fff9;border-radius:50%;right:-70px;top:-185px}
.dialog-rings:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px solid #fff9;border-radius:50%;inset:33px}
.dialog-eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:900;color:#468abc}
.dialog-hero h2{font-size:clamp(29px,4vw,43px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.07em;color:#265a7d;margin:20px 0}
.dialog-hero h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#449bd3}
.dialog-hero p{margin:0;color:#5a8aab;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;max-width:540px}
.dialog-draft-tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:27px;background:#fff9;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:100px;padding:9px 14px;color:#6999b8;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;font-weight:850}
.dialog-content{padding:35px 53px 37px}
.dialog-section-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-bottom:17px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5f2fa;color:#88aac1;font-size:10px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.12em}
.dialog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:13px;margin-top:21px}
.dialog-block{display:flex;gap:16px;min-height:113px;padding:20px 15px;border:1px solid #e5f0f8;border-radius:16px;background:#f9fdff}
.dialog-n{width:29px;height:29px;border-radius:9px;background:#e6f5ff;color:#559bca;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}
.dialog-block h3{margin:0;color:#356c92;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.dialog-block h3 small{display:block;color:#9bb5c5;font-weight:600;font-size:11px;margin-top:5px}
.dialog-block p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#7c9eaf;margin:12px 0 0}
.dialog-note{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;color:#8aa9ba;font-size:11px;margin:22px 0 0;line-height:1.6}
.dialog-note span{color:#81bcd9;font-size:17px}
.dialog-bottom-close{margin-top:24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;align-items:center;border:none;border-radius:100px;padding:12px 18px;background:#338dc8;color:white;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}
.dialog-bottom-close:hover{background:#237cb8}
@media(max-width:1050px){.ribbon-words{font-size:20px}.sky-ribbon-inner{min-height:85px}}
@media(max-width:760px){
 html{scroll-padding-top:78px}
 .site-header{top:3px;background:#e9f7ff77;backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}
 .sky-ribbon-inner{min-height:87px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding-top:15px;padding-bottom:15px}
 .ribbon-label{width:100%;font-size:9px}
 .ribbon-words{font-size:19px;gap:12px}
 .ribbon-words b{font-size:10px}
 .sky-ribbon a{font-size:9px}
 .hero-grid{padding-top:125px;padding-bottom:52px}
 .hero-art,.hero-art.reveal.is-visible{width:min(100%,390px);max-width:390px;height:365px;transform:none!important;margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:0;}
 .hero-orbit{width:350px;height:350px;left:50%;top:47%}
 .orbit-two{width:270px;height:270px}
 .sun-halo{width:350px;height:350px;left:50%;top:47%}
 .idea-window{width:min(335px,calc(100% - 16px));max-width:335px;left:50%;top:45%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) rotate(-4deg)}
 .sticker-left{top:45px;left:0;font-size:10px}
 .sticker-right{right:-5px;bottom:61px}
 .hero-landscape{bottom:0;height:87px}
 .hero-bottom-cloud{bottom:-84px}
 .about-principles{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:29px}
 .about-principles>div{padding:17px 8px}
 .about-principles strong{font-size:13px}
 .about-principles small{font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}
 .project-info{flex-wrap:wrap}
 .case-preview-btn{align-self:auto}
 .process-steps-heading{font-size:8px}
 .process-step{padding:18px 5px;gap:10px;grid-template-columns:30px 1fr 31px}
 .process-step-copy strong{font-size:18px}
 .process-step-copy small{font-size:11px;margin-left:8px}
 .process-step-copy>span{font-size:11px}
 .process-insight{padding:18px}
 .back-to-top{width:43px;height:43px;right:14px;bottom:18px}
 .case-dialog{width:calc(100% - 20px);padding:5px;max-height:94vh;border-radius:20px}
 .dialog-shell{border-radius:17px}
 .dialog-hero{padding:34px 23px}
 .dialog-content{padding:24px 21px}
 .dialog-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .dialog-block{min-height:0}
 .dialog-hero h2{font-size:29px}
}
@media(max-width:400px){
 .hero-art,.hero-art.reveal.is-visible{height:340px;max-width:100%;margin:3px auto 0;transform:none!important}
 .idea-window{max-width:310px;width:min(310px,calc(100% - 12px))}
 .hero-orbit{width:315px;height:315px;left:50%}
 .sun-halo{width:315px;height:315px;left:50%}
 .sticker-right{right:-1px;bottom:42px}
 .sticker-left{top:25px;left:0}
 .ribbon-words{font-size:16px;gap:9px}
 .sky-ribbon a{font-size:8px}
 .ribbon-words span{gap:4px}
 .project-info{flex-direction:column}
 .case-preview-btn{align-self:flex-start;margin-top:7px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.floating-sticker{animation:none}.back-to-top{transition:none}}
/* Keep large decorative clouds inside the visible viewport. */
html{overflow-x:clip}
/* V3 / factual profile & featured case study */
.profile-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:-21px 0 33px}
.profile-stats>div{padding:18px 19px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f8fcff,#eaf7ff);border:1px solid #d9edfa;border-radius:17px;min-height:101px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #699ec30a}
.profile-stats span{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:900;color:#6b9abb;margin-bottom:11px}
.profile-stats strong{display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#326d95;letter-spacing:-.045em}
.profile-stats small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#7b9cb1;font-size:10px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.exit4-cover{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b1524!important;isolation:isolate}
.exit4-cover>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 45%;filter:saturate(.8) brightness(.76);transform:scale(1.01);transition:transform .45s ease,filter .4s ease}
.project-card:hover .exit4-cover>img{transform:scale(1.045);filter:saturate(.95) brightness(.82)}
.exit4-gradient{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,#07142bea 0%,#07142b60 48%,transparent 86%),linear-gradient(90deg,#07142b55,transparent 65%)}
.exit4-chip{background:#e2f8ff!important;color:#226c95!important;border-color:#bce6f8!important}
.exit4-cover-title{position:absolute;left:32px;bottom:34px;color:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;z-index:2}
.exit4-cover-title>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.17em;font-weight:900;color:#bfefff}
.exit4-cover-title strong{font-size:clamp(45px,5vw,75px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:8px 0 4px;color:#fff}
.exit4-cover-title small{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#d5e9f6;letter-spacing:-.04em}
.exit4-cover-corner{position:absolute;right:24px;bottom:29px;color:#cfdfec;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:800}
.project-summary h3 small{font-size:.67em;color:#78a1bb;font-weight:700;margin-left:9px}
.project-summary p{max-width:550px}
.project-inline-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:15px}
.project-inline-tags span{background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #dbeef8;border-radius:100px;color:#5a94bc;padding:7px 9px;font-size:9px;font-weight:750}
.live-dot{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#3cb7b1;margin-right:6px;vertical-align:middle}
.real-project-btn{background:#e4f5ff;color:#186d9d}
.contact-links{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:stretch;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:33px auto 0}
.contact-method{min-width:255px;padding:15px 20px;display:flex;gap:14px;text-align:left;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eefa;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #5699c31a;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.contact-method:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px #5699c32c}
.contact-method-icon{width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#e9f7ff;border-radius:14px;color:#438cb9;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0}
.contact-method span:nth-child(2){flex:1}
.contact-method small{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:900;color:#7da5bc}
.contact-method strong{font-size:13px;color:#316d94;display:block;margin-top:6px}
.contact-method>b{font-size:18px;color:#7fb2d2}
.contact-top-new{display:block;margin-top:25px!important}
.exit4-dialog{border:0;padding:10px;width:min(1060px,calc(100% - 30px));max-height:94vh;background:transparent;color:#254f70;overflow:auto;margin:auto;scrollbar-width:thin;border-radius:23px}
.exit4-dialog::backdrop{background:#13304baa;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
.exit4-modal-shell{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 90px #0f34557a}
.exit4-dialog-bar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:11px 24px;background:#f5fbffed;backdrop-filter:blur(15px);border-bottom:1px solid #dcecf4;color:#5483a2;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em}
.exit4-dialog-bar i{width:8px;height:8px;display:inline-block;border-radius:50%;background:#46c5bf;margin-right:7px}
.exit4-close{border:0;background:#e4f3fd;border-radius:30px;color:#337caf;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:900}
.exit4-close:hover{background:#c9e9fd}
.exit4-close small{font-size:11px}
.exit4-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.07fr .93fr;min-height:390px;background:#edf9ff;overflow:hidden}
.exit4-head-copy{padding:57px 36px 43px 52px;position:relative;z-index:1;background:radial-gradient(circle at 0 0,#fff,transparent 75%)}
.exit4-kicker{font-size:10px;color:#5c91b7;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.1em;display:flex;gap:17px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.exit4-kicker span{color:#85aac4}
.exit4-head h2{font-size:clamp(53px,7vw,91px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.075em;color:#205576;margin:21px 0 0;font-weight:900}
.exit4-title-dot{color:#5db5dd}
.exit4-head h3{font-size:22px;margin:0;color:#3d7ea6;letter-spacing:-.055em}
.exit4-head p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#6d91a7;max-width:460px;margin-top:20px}
.exit4-pills{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:20px 0}
.exit4-pills span{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#538fb3;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cce9f7;border-radius:30px;padding:7px 10px}
.exit4-pdf{display:inline-flex;gap:20px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#2f83b8;border-radius:100px;color:white!important;padding:13px 17px;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;box-shadow:0 9px 23px #5695be36}
.exit4-pdf:hover{background:#1b6b9d}
.exit4-pdf span{font-size:17px}
.exit4-head-image{position:relative;margin:0;min-height:400px;background:#111a29;overflow:hidden}
.exit4-head-image img{position:absolute;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 51%}
.exit4-head-image figcaption{position:absolute;right:19px;bottom:18px;color:white;font-size:10px;background:#091c35a9;border-radius:12px;padding:9px 11px}
.exit4-body{padding:35px 52px 50px}
.case-section{padding:33px 0 43px;border-bottom:1px solid #e4eff7}
.case-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#51a5c8;font-weight:900}
.case-section h3{font-size:clamp(21px,3vw,29px);line-height:1.43;letter-spacing:-.065em;color:#275b80;margin:15px 0 18px}
.case-lead{color:#62849a;line-height:1.9;font-size:14px;max-width:830px}
.case-loop{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:23px}
.case-loop span{flex:1;min-width:115px;text-align:center;padding:18px 8px;background:#eef8ff;border:1px solid #d6eafa;border-radius:14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;color:#387ba5}
.case-loop b{color:#73b0d3;font-size:20px}
.case-scope-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .7fr;gap:14px}
.case-scope{padding:25px 26px;border-radius:19px}
.case-scope.personal{background:#eff9ff;border:1px solid #d5eefa}
.case-scope.team{background:#f6f8fb;border:1px solid #e1e9ef}
.scope-kicker{font-weight:950;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#4d9ecc;margin-bottom:18px}
.case-scope ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0;display:grid;gap:11px}
.case-scope li{font-size:13px;color:#567f99;line-height:1.7}
.case-scope li strong{color:#2c719f;margin-right:6px}
.case-scope.team p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#6f8697;margin-top:0}
.team-note{font-size:11px;background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:13px;color:#6794ab;line-height:1.7}
.case-comparison{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 23px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-top:25px}
.case-comparison figure{margin:0;padding:10px 10px 16px;border-radius:17px;background:#eef6fc;border:1px solid #dbeaf3}
.case-comparison img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:10px;aspect-ratio:1.82;object-fit:cover}
.case-comparison figcaption{margin:14px 5px 0;color:#668fa9;font-size:11px}
.case-comparison figcaption b{color:#2c83b9;margin-right:7px}
.case-compare-arrow{text-align:center;color:#50accc;font-size:22px}
.case-decision{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;margin-top:23px;background:#eaf7ff;padding:20px;border-radius:16px;font-size:13px;color:#377a9d}
.case-decision span{font-weight:950;color:#5da9c8;letter-spacing:.1em}
.case-card-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px}
.case-card-row article{padding:23px;border-radius:16px;background:#f2f9fe;border:1px solid #dfedf6}
.case-card-row article>span{font-size:10px;color:#65a6ca;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:900}
.case-card-row h4{font-size:18px;margin:12px 0 9px;color:#316f99}
.case-card-row p{font-size:13px;color:#698ca1;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:0}
.case-graphic{background:#eaf7ff;display:flex;gap:19px;align-items:center;border:1px solid #d7ebf7;border-radius:17px;margin-top:14px;padding:18px}
.case-graphic div{flex:1;min-width:0}
.case-graphic span{color:#79a9c9;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:900}
.case-graphic strong{display:block;color:#2c739c;font-size:20px;margin:12px 0}
.case-graphic small{color:#7092a4;line-height:1.6;font-size:12px}
.case-graphic img{width:38%;border-radius:11px;object-fit:cover}
.case-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}
.case-flow div{border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #dcebf4;padding:18px;background:#f4faff;min-height:135px}
.case-flow b{display:block;color:#60abd1;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:16px}
.case-flow strong{font-size:17px;display:block;color:#397eaa;margin-bottom:10px}
.case-flow small{font-size:11px;color:#789bae;line-height:1.7}
.case-note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#7da2b8;margin-top:15px}
.qa-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:11px;margin:25px 0 14px}
.qa-stats div{padding:20px;background:#eff9ff;border-radius:15px;border:1px solid #daeffb}
.qa-stats span,.qa-stats small{display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#7da3bc}
.qa-stats strong{display:block;font-size:41px;color:#297daf;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}
.case-disclaimer{font-size:11px;color:#91a6b6;line-height:1.8;margin:0}
.exit4-last{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:22px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#245e89,#3c98bf);padding:29px 28px;color:#fff;border-radius:19px;margin:28px 0 0}
.exit4-last>div{max-width:560px}
.exit4-last span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:950;color:#bcefff}
.exit4-last strong{display:block;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:10px 0}
.exit4-last p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#e0f2ff}
.exit4-pdf-light{background:#fff!important;color:#2578a8!important;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:none}
.exit4-pdf-light span{color:#287baa}
@media(max-width:850px){.profile-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.profile-stats>div:last-child{grid-column:span 2}.exit4-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.exit4-head-image{height:300px;min-height:0}.exit4-head-image img{object-position:center 40%}.exit4-body{padding:25px 28px 36px}.exit4-head-copy{padding:40px 32px 30px}.case-scope-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.exit4-last{flex-wrap:wrap}}
@media(max-width:760px){.exit4-dialog{width:calc(100% - 12px);padding:0;max-height:96vh;border-radius:15px}.exit4-modal-shell{border-radius:16px}.exit4-dialog-bar{padding:9px 14px;font-size:8px}.exit4-close{font-size:14px;padding:9px 12px}.exit4-close small{display:none}.exit4-head-copy{padding:31px 23px 29px}.exit4-head h2{font-size:61px}.exit4-head h3{font-size:19px}.exit4-head-image{height:250px}.exit4-body{padding:20px 20px 30px}.case-section{padding:26px 0 32px}.case-loop{gap:7px}.case-loop span{min-width:calc(50% - 22px);padding:14px 7px}.case-loop b:nth-of-type(2){display:none}.case-scope{padding:19px}.case-comparison{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}.case-compare-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);font-size:18px}.case-card-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.case-graphic{flex-wrap:wrap}.case-graphic img{width:100%}.case-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.qa-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.qa-stats div:first-child{grid-column:span 2}.qa-stats strong{font-size:31px}.exit4-last{padding:22px}.exit4-last strong{font-size:20px}.exit4-cover-title{left:24px;bottom:32px}.exit4-cover-title strong{font-size:52px}.exit4-cover-corner{display:none}.project-summary h3 small{display:block;margin:6px 0 0}.profile-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin:0 0 30px}.profile-stats>div:last-child{grid-column:auto}.profile-stats>div{min-height:auto;padding:15px 17px}.contact-method{width:100%;max-width:370px}.contact-method strong{font-size:12px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.exit4-cover>img,.project-card:hover .exit4-cover>img{transition:none;transform:none}}


/* V4 — Brand alignment using the supplied Bloxity project logo. */
.bloxity-cover-logo{
 position:absolute;z-index:2;left:50%;top:49%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
 width:clamp(230px,37%,375px);aspect-ratio:370 / 195;
 display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
 background:#fdfdfd; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.93);
 border-radius:23px;box-shadow:0 22px 58px #071a3566,0 3px 18px #06122a3b;
 overflow:hidden;transition:transform .28s ease,box-shadow .28s ease;
}
.bloxity-cover-logo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}
.project-card:hover .bloxity-cover-logo{transform:translate(-50%,-52%);box-shadow:0 26px 64px #071a3580}
.bloxity-cover-subtitle{position:absolute;z-index:2;bottom:30px;left:33px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#f0fbff;font-weight:900;text-shadow:0 2px 8px #071c35}
.real-project .project-summary h3{line-height:1.25;max-width:740px;letter-spacing:-.043em;font-size:clamp(22px,2.8vw,31px)}
.real-project .project-summary h3 small{display:block;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:8px 0 0;color:#729ab5}
.bloxity-modal-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;margin:17px 0 4px!important;width:min(100%,335px);line-height:normal!important}
.bloxity-modal-heading img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;mix-blend-mode:multiply;border-radius:7px}
.bloxity-internal-note{margin:6px 0 0!important;color:#8babc0!important;font-size:10px!important}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .bloxity-cover-logo{width:min(70%,275px);top:49%;border-radius:17px}
 .bloxity-cover-subtitle{left:23px;bottom:22px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.07em}
 .bloxity-modal-heading{width:min(85%,300px);margin:11px 0 4px!important}
 .real-project .project-summary h3{font-size:23px}
}
@media(max-width:420px){.bloxity-cover-logo{width:min(70%,245px)}.bloxity-cover-subtitle{max-width:83%;font-size:8px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.bloxity-cover-logo{transition:none}}

/* V5 / design-first case study */
.design-scope-grid,.design-why-grid,.design-quest-grid,.design-boss-pillars,.design-enemy-grid,.design-event-grid{display:grid;gap:14px;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:26px}
.design-scope-grid article,.design-quest-grid article,.design-event-grid article,.design-boss-pillars article,.design-enemy-grid>div{padding:24px;background:#f1f8ff;border:1px solid #e2eff8;border-radius:21px}
.design-scope-grid article:nth-child(2),.design-quest-grid article:nth-child(2),.design-event-grid article:nth-child(2),.design-boss-pillars article:nth-child(2){background:#f5f1ff}
.design-scope-grid article:nth-child(3),.design-quest-grid article:nth-child(3),.design-event-grid article:nth-child(3),.design-boss-pillars article:nth-child(3){background:#eef9f5}
.design-scope-grid span,.design-quest-top span,.design-event-grid span,.design-boss-hero span,.design-phase-grid span{display:block;color:#418ec9;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em}
.design-scope-grid h4,.design-quest-grid h4,.design-event-grid h4{font-size:19px;line-height:1.48;margin:10px 0}
.design-scope-grid p,.design-quest-grid p,.design-event-grid p,.design-boss-pillars p,.design-enemy-grid p,.design-boss-hero p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.84;color:#52697f;margin:8px 0 0}
.design-quote,.design-rule{margin-top:25px;background:#e6f5ff;border-left:4px solid #61ace3;padding:23px 26px;border-radius:15px}
.design-quote strong,.design-rule span{display:block;color:#287dba;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em}
.design-quote p{font-size:18px;color:#14324e;font-weight:800;line-height:1.7;margin:8px 0 0}
.design-rule strong{display:block;color:#173b59;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;margin:8px 0}
.design-rule p{font-size:13px;color:#52697f;line-height:1.7;margin:0}
.design-why-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.design-why-grid>div{background:#f5f9fd;border-radius:16px;padding:16px}
.design-why-grid b{font-size:13px;color:#4094d2}
.design-why-grid p{font-size:13px;color:#52697f;line-height:1.7;margin:6px 0 0}
.design-quest-grid,.design-event-grid,.design-boss-pillars{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
.design-quest-grid article{padding:19px}
.design-quest-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}
.design-quest-top b{font-size:11px;color:#617c91}
.design-quest-grid h4{font-size:17px}
.design-quest-grid strong{font-size:12px;color:#287bb4;line-height:1.6;display:block;margin-top:14px}
.design-enemy-image{border-radius:19px;overflow:hidden;background:#0c1c33;margin:22px 0 14px}
.design-enemy-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.design-enemy-image figcaption{font-size:12px;padding:11px 15px;color:#e7f2ff}
.design-enemy-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
.design-enemy-grid>div{padding:15px;background:#f6f9fc}
.design-enemy-grid strong{font-size:14px;color:#173b5b}
.design-enemy-grid p{font-size:12px;margin-top:7px}
.design-boss-section{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f5faff 0%,#fff 38%);border-radius:28px;padding:32px !important}
.design-boss-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:25px;align-items:center;margin-top:25px;background:#10263d;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;padding:18px}
.design-boss-hero img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:14px}
.design-boss-hero span{color:#81cdfa}
.design-boss-hero h4{font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;color:white;margin:12px 0 14px}
.design-boss-hero p{color:#e0ecf4}
.design-boss-hero p.design-muted{color:#b9ccd9;font-size:12px}
.design-boss-pillars article{padding:18px}
.design-boss-pillars b{font-size:15px;color:#1b5684}
.design-subheading{font-size:20px;font-weight:850;color:#163b5b;margin:38px 0 8px}
.design-phase-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}
.design-phase-grid article{padding:24px;background:#f2f8fc;border-radius:19px;min-height:155px}
.design-phase-grid article:last-child{background:#e9f5fd}
.design-phase-grid strong{display:block;font-size:24px;margin:15px 0 8px;color:#183b5b}
.design-phase-grid p{font-size:13px;color:#52697f;line-height:1.7;margin:0}
.design-phase-arrow{font-size:25px;color:#5fabe0}
.design-download-group{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end}
.design-download-group a{text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
@media (max-width:820px){
 .design-scope-grid,.design-why-grid,.design-quest-grid,.design-boss-pillars,.design-event-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:11px}
 .design-enemy-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
 .design-boss-section{padding:21px !important;border-radius:20px}
 .design-boss-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}
 .design-boss-hero img{height:190px;object-fit:contain;object-position:center}
 .design-boss-hero h4{font-size:20px}
 .design-phase-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}
 .design-phase-arrow{text-align:center;transform:rotate(90deg)}
 .design-download-group{justify-content:flex-start}
}
@media (max-width:480px){.design-quote{padding:18px}.design-quote p{font-size:15px}.design-boss-section{padding:14px!important}.design-enemy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.design-enemy-grid>div{padding:11px}.design-boss-hero{padding:12px}.design-quest-grid article,.design-scope-grid article{padding:17px}}

/* V6 · Playthrough and actual design evidence */
.stagea-video{width:100%;border-radius:20px;display:block;background:#0b1e35;box-shadow:0 18px 54px rgba(33,97,156,.18);aspect-ratio:1280 / 412}
.stagea-video-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px 18px;margin:12px 0 18px;font-size:12px;color:#6b8a9e}
.stagea-video-actions a{color:#2474b5;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.stagea-chapters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:14px 0 0}
.stagea-chapters button{border:1px solid #badcf0;background:#edf8ff;border-radius:999px;color:#32648c;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;transition:.15s}
.stagea-chapters button b{background:white;color:#167dbb;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 5px;font-size:10px}
.stagea-chapters button:hover,.stagea-chapters button:focus-visible{background:#d8f1ff;border-color:#55b8ee;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.stagea-flow-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-top:25px}
.stagea-flow-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(430px,470px) 1fr;gap:28px;align-items:center;background:#f5fbff;border:1px solid #dceefb;border-radius:19px;padding:20px 22px}
.stagea-flow-list img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:14px;background:#112039;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(27,61,98,.14)}
.stagea-flow-list span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.09em;color:#418abe;font-weight:800}
.stagea-flow-list h4{font-size:17px;margin:6px 0 8px;color:#173a60}
.stagea-flow-list p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#415e75;margin:0 0 9px}
.stagea-flow-list small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#387ead;line-height:1.5}
.stagea-branch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;align-items:stretch;margin:24px 0;padding:18px;background:#f3f9ff;border-radius:18px}
.stagea-branch>div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#c8eaff;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;font-weight:800;color:#226b9b;text-align:center;line-height:1.5}
.stagea-branch article{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:120px;padding:18px;background:white;border-radius:14px;color:#2b4b66;border:1px solid #d6e9f6;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(86,153,195,.08)}
.stagea-branch article b,.stagea-branch article small{display:block}
.stagea-branch article b{font-size:22px;line-height:1.35;color:#2b5f86;letter-spacing:-.03em}
.stagea-branch article small{font-size:11px;color:#4b9fc8;margin:8px 0 9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
.stagea-branch article p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0;color:#486578}
.stagea-boss-phases,.stagea-ending{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;margin:23px 0}
.stagea-boss-phases figure,.stagea-ending figure{margin:0;background:#f2f9ff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #daecf8}
.stagea-boss-phases img,.stagea-ending img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16 / 10;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.stagea-boss-phases figcaption,.stagea-ending figcaption{padding:12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#2b668d}.stagea-boss-phases figcaption b{display:block;color:#1778b3;margin-bottom:4px}
@media(max-width:700px){.stagea-flow-list article{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:11px;gap:12px}.stagea-flow-list img{aspect-ratio:16/8}.stagea-boss-phases,.stagea-ending{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stagea-video-actions{font-size:11px}.stagea-branch{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}.stagea-branch>div{justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left}}

.stagea-flow-list img.wide-shot{aspect-ratio:1566/500;object-fit:contain;background:#eef6fb;padding:6px}
@media(max-width:700px){.stagea-flow-list img.wide-shot{aspect-ratio:1566/500;padding:4px}}

/* V13 – creature and boss design case study */
.monster-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:15px;margin:24px 0}
.monster-grid article{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #d8eaf5;border-radius:17px;background:#f2f9ff}
.monster-grid img{width:100%;height:175px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;display:block;background:#e8f4ff}
.monster-copy{padding:16px}.monster-copy>span,.boss-identity-feature>div>span,.boss-attack-grid article>span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#2789bf;font-weight:800}
.monster-copy h4{font-size:18px;margin:7px 0;color:#153a5a}.monster-copy b{display:block;color:#2789bf;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:10px}.monster-copy p{font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#4e687d;margin:0}
.monster-training{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#e8f6ff;padding:16px;border-radius:15px;font-size:12px;color:#256b95}
.monster-training b{color:#173a61;margin-right:10px}.monster-training em{font-style:normal;color:#45a1c7}.monster-training span{background:white;border-radius:9px;padding:7px 10px}
.boss-identity-feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:20px;align-items:stretch;margin:26px 0}
.boss-identity-feature figure{margin:0;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #d8eaf5;background:#ecf7ff}
.boss-identity-feature img{width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover}.boss-identity-feature figcaption,.boss-arena-layout figcaption{font-size:11px;padding:10px 15px;color:#46799b}
.boss-identity-feature>div{border-radius:18px;background:#f2f9ff;padding:22px}.boss-identity-feature h4{font-size:20px;color:#173b5f;margin:8px 0 12px}
.boss-identity-feature p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#44667d}.boss-concept-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}.boss-concept-tags span{font-size:10px;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:white;color:#378abb;border:1px solid #d3e8f6}
.boss-subheading{margin:32px 0 13px;font-size:18px;color:#163a5d}
.boss-attack-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.boss-attack-grid article{padding:18px;background:#f6fbff;border:1px solid #d6e9f6;border-radius:15px}.boss-attack-grid h4{font-size:18px;margin:8px 0 14px;color:#173a5d}.boss-attack-grid p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#425f77;margin:8px 0}.boss-attack-grid b{color:#378dbf;margin-right:7px}
.boss-pattern-summary{border-radius:15px;background:#e4f6ef;padding:17px 20px;margin:17px 0 25px;font-size:12px}.boss-pattern-summary strong{color:#197b72;margin-right:15px}.boss-pattern-summary span{color:#185e66;font-weight:700}.boss-pattern-summary p{margin:9px 0 0;color:#4b6b76;line-height:1.65}
.boss-arena-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:18px;margin:17px 0}.boss-arena-layout figure{border:1px solid #d5e7f5;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;margin:0;background:#f4faff}.boss-arena-layout img{width:100%;display:block;object-fit:contain;max-height:340px}.boss-arena-layout>div{background:#f2f9ff;border-radius:16px;padding:21px}.boss-arena-layout>div p{line-height:1.75;font-size:12px;color:#506e82;margin:0 0 13px}.boss-arena-layout>div b{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#216f9f;margin-bottom:4px}
@media(max-width:720px){.monster-grid,.boss-attack-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.monster-grid img{height:215px}.boss-identity-feature,.boss-arena-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* V14: Introductory case-study summary without redundant hero gameplay image */
#exit4-dialog .exit4-head{display:block;min-height:0;background:#edf9ff}
#exit4-dialog .exit4-head-copy{padding:39px 52px 38px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 2% 0%,#fff 0%,#edf9ff 78%)}
#exit4-dialog .exit4-head p{max-width:740px}
@media(max-width:850px){#exit4-dialog .exit4-head-copy{padding:34px 30px 32px}}
@media(max-width:760px){#exit4-dialog .exit4-head-copy{padding:27px 23px 28px}}


.case-overview{padding-top:28px}
.overview-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(320px,.95fr);gap:20px;align-items:start}
.overview-left,.overview-right{min-width:0}
.overview-copy{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fdff 0%,#eef8ff 100%);border:1px solid #dcebfa;border-radius:22px;padding:22px 24px 20px;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(96,149,186,.10)}
.overview-eyebrow,.overview-label{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:900;color:#368cbc}
.overview-copy h3{margin:8px 0 12px!important;font-size:28px!important;line-height:1.34!important;color:#214c70!important}
.overview-desc{margin:0;color:#56788f;font-size:13px;line-height:1.85}
.overview-pills{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
.overview-pills span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #cce6f5;background:#fff;color:#4f85a5;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
.overview-startshot{margin:16px 0 0;border:1px solid #d8ebf6;background:#fff;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(82,132,166,.12)}
.overview-startshot img{display:block;width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;background:#eef6fb}
.overview-startshot figcaption{padding:10px 14px 12px;background:#f8fcff;color:#66869c;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55}
.overview-startshot strong{color:#2b6489}
.overview-reference{margin-top:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9edf8;border-radius:22px;padding:18px 18px 16px;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(96,149,186,.10)}
.overview-reference h4,.overview-summary-card h4,.overview-role-card h4{margin:5px 0 10px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#214c70}
.overview-reference-lead{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75;color:#55778d}
.overview-reference-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 210px;gap:14px;align-items:start}
.overview-reference-card{background:#f8fcff;border:1px solid #e2eef7;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 15px}
.overview-reference-card strong{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#1f5880;margin-bottom:8px}
.overview-reference-card ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px;color:#496b83;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.68}
.overview-reference-card li+li{margin-top:4px}
.overview-reference-visual{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2eef7;border-radius:16px;padding:8px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(87,132,164,.10);margin:0}
.overview-reference-visual img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:160px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:12px;background:#fff}
.overview-reference-visual figcaption{padding:8px 4px 2px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;color:#64859c;text-align:center}
.overview-loop{margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #d5e6f3;padding-top:16px}
.overview-loop span{display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#338cba;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px}
.overview-loop div{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:800;color:#3b657f}
.overview-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;margin-top:15px;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 18px;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;background:#2f85b7;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 8px 21px rgba(47,133,183,.20)}
.overview-summary-card,.overview-role-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9edf8;border-radius:22px;padding:18px 18px 16px;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(96,149,186,.10)}
.overview-summary-card dl{margin:10px 0 0;display:grid;gap:10px}
.overview-summary-card dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:74px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start;font-size:12px}
.overview-summary-card dt{margin:0;color:#849eb0;font-weight:800}
.overview-summary-card dd{margin:0;color:#294f6b;font-weight:750;line-height:1.5}
.overview-role-card{margin-top:16px}
.overview-role-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-bottom:13px}
.overview-role-head small{font-size:10px;color:#79a0b9;font-weight:800;white-space:nowrap}
.overview-difficulty{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;background:#edf8ff;border:1px solid #d9eefa;border-radius:13px;padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:13px}
.overview-difficulty-title{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;color:#587f99;white-space:nowrap}
.overview-difficulty-flow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;margin-left:auto}
.overview-difficulty-flow span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #c8e3f5;background:#fff;font-size:12px;color:#2378a8;font-weight:900}
.overview-difficulty-flow span.active{color:#176b9a;background:#d3efff;border-color:#9fd3ef;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(63,146,198,.14)}
.overview-difficulty-flow i{font-style:normal;color:#6daacc;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}
.overview-difficulty-note{font-size:10px;color:#4a91b9;font-weight:850;white-space:nowrap}
.overview-stage-list{position:relative;display:grid;gap:9px;margin-left:1px}
.overview-stage-list:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:13px;top:24px;bottom:29px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(#c7e8f7,#4fa9d9)}
.overview-stage-item{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:11px 12px 11px 22px;border:1px solid #e1edf6;border-radius:13px;background:#fbfdff}
.overview-stage-item.mine{background:#e8f7ff;border-color:#9ed6f2;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(60,141,195,.11)}
.overview-stage-key{min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:3px;padding-left:6px}
.overview-stage-key .dot{position:absolute;left:5px;top:calc(50% - 5px);width:11px;height:11px;border:2px solid #fff;background:#78b6d7;border-radius:99px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #cde9f7}
.overview-stage-item.mine .overview-stage-key .dot{background:#2089c1;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #bde5fa}
.overview-stage-key strong{font-size:12px;font-weight:900;color:#285d81;white-space:nowrap}
.overview-stage-key small{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#86a4b6;font-weight:750;white-space:nowrap}
.overview-stage-name{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;line-height:1.25}
.overview-stage-name b{font-size:13px;color:#193d5b}
.overview-stage-name span{font-size:9px;font-weight:850;color:#267cac;padding:3px 7px;background:#d5f0ff;border-radius:30px}
.overview-stage-info p{margin:5px 0 0;font-size:10.8px;line-height:1.55;color:#51738b;word-break:keep-all}
.overview-stage-item.mine .overview-stage-info p{color:#255d80;font-weight:680}
@media(max-width:950px){.overview-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.overview-startshot img{height:250px}.overview-reference-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.overview-reference-visual{max-width:220px;margin:0 auto}.overview-role-head small{white-space:normal}.overview-stage-item{grid-template-columns:108px minmax(0,1fr);gap:9px}}
@media(max-width:760px){.case-overview{padding-top:20px}.overview-copy,.overview-reference,.overview-summary-card,.overview-role-card{padding:16px}.overview-copy h3{font-size:23px!important}.overview-desc,.overview-reference-lead{font-size:12px}.overview-startshot img{height:220px}.overview-summary-card dl div{grid-template-columns:68px 1fr}.overview-difficulty{padding:10px 11px}.overview-difficulty-flow{margin-left:0}.overview-stage-item{grid-template-columns:102px minmax(0,1fr);padding:10px 10px 10px 22px}.overview-stage-info p{font-size:10.6px}}


/* V16: opening image is shown in full without cropping */
.overview-startshot img{height:auto;max-height:470px;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:#f4fbff}


/* V24 — boss pattern gallery aligned with the V24 design PDF */
.boss-pattern-gallery{display:grid;gap:17px;margin:23px 0 26px}
.boss-pattern-case{border:1px solid #d7e8f5;border-radius:20px;padding:19px 21px 20px;background:#f2f9ff;min-width:0}
.boss-pattern-case.purple{background:#f4f1ff;border-color:#e1daf9}
.boss-pattern-case.orange{background:#fff6e9;border-color:#f5dfc3}
.boss-pattern-case-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.boss-pattern-case-head span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.10em;font-weight:900;color:#318cbf}
.boss-pattern-case-head h5{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.045em;color:#193e5f;margin:0}
.boss-pattern-case-content{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.42fr) minmax(220px,.82fr);gap:18px;align-items:stretch}
.boss-pattern-case-photos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:11px;min-width:0}
.boss-pattern-case-photos figure{margin:0;border:1px solid #d9e8f5;border-radius:13px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;min-width:0}
.boss-pattern-case-photos img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.65;object-fit:contain;background:#f6faff}
.boss-pattern-case-photos figcaption{padding:9px 8px;text-align:center;color:#2b668d;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}
.boss-pattern-case-copy{border:1px solid #dcecf5;background:#ffffffc9;border-radius:14px;padding:15px 15px 13px;min-width:0}
.boss-pattern-case-copy>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:8px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e8f0f7;line-height:1.7}
.boss-pattern-case-copy>div:first-child{padding-top:0}
.boss-pattern-case-copy b{color:#2b89bc;font-size:12px}
.boss-pattern-case-copy span{font-size:12px;color:#3d5e75}
.boss-pattern-case-copy p{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#55778d}
@media(max-width:860px){.boss-pattern-case-content{grid-template-columns:1fr}.boss-pattern-case-copy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}}
@media(max-width:550px){.boss-pattern-case{padding:14px 12px}.boss-pattern-case-head{gap:9px}.boss-pattern-case-head h5{font-size:18px}.boss-pattern-case-photos{gap:8px}.boss-pattern-case-photos figcaption{font-size:10px}.boss-pattern-case-copy>div{grid-template-columns:42px 1fr}.boss-pattern-case-copy span{font-size:11px}}

/* V27 - links to externally hosted playthrough only (no video embeds) */
.exit4-resource-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:22px}
.exit4-resource-links .exit4-pdf{margin-top:0}
.exit4-youtube{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;min-height:44px;padding:13px 17px;border:1px solid #bee3f5;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:#2377ac;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(60,139,189,.12);text-decoration:none}
.exit4-youtube:hover,.stagea-flow-video-link:hover{background:#e5f6ff;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.exit4-youtube span{font-size:17px}
.stagea-flow-video-link{display:inline-flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:#e9f7ff;border:1px solid #c4e5f8;color:#226f9e;font-size:12px;font-weight:850;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s,background .2s}
@media(max-width:700px){.exit4-resource-links{gap:9px}.exit4-youtube{width:100%;justify-content:center}.stagea-flow-video-link{font-size:11px}}

/* AI tools used in the team-project workflow */
.overview-ai-tools{margin-top:16px;padding:13px 15px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6eaf6;border-radius:16px}
.overview-ai-heading{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#2c86b9;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.08em}
.overview-ai-heading span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:650;color:#7595a9}
.overview-ai-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:9px}
.overview-ai-grid>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;min-width:0}
.overview-ai-grid strong{color:#1e587d;font-size:12px}
.overview-ai-grid span{color:#557b92;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;word-break:keep-all}
@media(max-width:480px){.overview-ai-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px}}
/* PROJECT 02: 오늘도 무사히 — ADDITIONAL PREVIEW STYLES ONLY */
.runner-cover{background:#dff3ff;box-shadow:0 15px 32px #a8d0e42b;position:relative}
.runner-cover>img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:#dff3ff}
.runner-cover-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#183b5705 40%,#052c5277 100%);pointer-events:none}
.runner-cover-chip{background:#fffef3eb;color:#236696;border:1px solid #fff!important}
.runner-cover-year,.runner-cover-sub{position:absolute;color:#fff;font-weight:900;text-shadow:0 2px 7px #173f587b;letter-spacing:.09em}
.runner-cover-year{right:18px;bottom:19px;font-size:10px}
.runner-cover-sub{left:20px;bottom:19px;font-size:10px;max-width:59%}
.runner-project-info .project-type{font-size:11px}
.runner-project-info h3 small{display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:700}
.runner-project-info p{line-height:1.8}
.runner-dialog{--runner-blue:#2d86b7;--runner-ink:#163a55;--runner-muted:#617f94;--runner-border:#dcebf5}
.runner-dialog .exit4-dialog-bar{font-family:inherit}
.runner-dialog .exit4-dialog-bar .runner-bar-dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#59c1bb;margin-right:8px}
.runner-dialog .runner-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.03fr .97fr;min-height:340px;background:#f0faff}
.runner-hero-copy{padding:56px 35px 48px 53px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 0 0,#fff,transparent 77%)}
.runner-kicker{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#5792b8}
.runner-kicker i{display:inline-block;background:#e1b756;border-radius:99px;width:7px;height:7px}
.runner-hero h2{margin:22px 0 12px;font-weight:950;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-size:clamp(37px,5vw,60px);line-height:1.12;color:#184a70}
.runner-hero h2 span{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#4487b0}
.runner-hero p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#546f83;max-width:480px}
.runner-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:24px}
.runner-meta span{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;border:1px solid #c8e4f3;border-radius:50px;padding:8px 11px;background:#fff;color:#397ea5}
.runner-hero-image{min-height:300px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.runner-hero-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;background:#dff3ff}
.runner-hero-image:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(0deg,#10375098,transparent 50%)}
.runner-image-label{position:absolute;bottom:23px;left:24px;z-index:1;background:#ffffffed;border-radius:18px;padding:9px 14px;color:#306783;font-size:11px;font-weight:900}
.runner-body{padding:24px 49px 49px;color:var(--runner-ink)}
.runner-quick-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:0 0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--runner-border)}
.runner-quick-nav button{background:#eff8ff;border:1px solid #d8ebf8;border-radius:24px;color:#477e9d;padding:9px 13px;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}
.runner-quick-nav button:hover{background:#dbf0ff}
.runner-section{padding:37px 0 38px;border-bottom:1px solid #dcebf5;scroll-margin-top:56px}
.runner-section:last-child{border:0}
.runner-eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#5b9bc0;margin:0 0 9px}
.runner-section h3{font-size:clamp(21px,2.6vw,28px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 12px;color:#1a4e74}
.runner-section .runner-lead{font-size:14px;line-height:1.93;color:#617b8c;margin:0 0 23px}
.runner-grid{display:grid;gap:13px;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}
.runner-panel{background:#f5fbff;border:1px solid #dfedf6;padding:22px 19px;border-radius:15px}
.runner-panel strong{font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#245d87;display:block;margin-bottom:8px}
.runner-panel p{color:#638195;line-height:1.8;font-size:12px;margin:0}
.runner-number{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;color:#2887b6;background:#e1f3ff;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px;margin:0 0 12px}
.runner-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}
.runner-fact{background:#f7fbff;border:1px solid #e1eef7;padding:15px 13px;border-radius:14px}
.runner-fact dt{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;color:#89a4b7;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:8px}
.runner-fact dd{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:850;color:#2b6487}
.runner-story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-top:22px}
.runner-story img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1.8/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:15px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #22445e17}
.runner-story p{font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#536f83;margin:0}
.runner-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;align-items:stretch;margin-bottom:19px}
.runner-flow div{background:#f0f9ff;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid #dfedf5;padding:14px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;min-height:98px}
.runner-flow b{font-size:12px;color:#2b739a}
.runner-flow small{font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;color:#7594a7}
.runner-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:17px}
.runner-gallery figure{margin:0;background:#f5faff;padding:10px 10px 13px;border:1px solid #e0edf6;border-radius:14px}
.runner-gallery img{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.88/1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:9px}
.runner-gallery figcaption{padding:10px 3px 1px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.6;color:#4e7c98}
.runner-feature-rows{display:grid;gap:11px}
.runner-feature-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:115px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:start;border:1px solid #dcecf5;border-radius:13px;padding:15px;background:#fff}
.runner-feature-row b{color:#2b7cae;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}
.runner-feature-row p{color:#58748a;line-height:1.8;font-size:12px;margin:0}
.runner-compare{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 44px 1fr;gap:9px;align-items:stretch}
.runner-compare>div:not(.runner-arrow){background:#f4faff;border:1px solid #dfeef7;border-radius:13px;padding:19px}
.runner-compare strong{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;color:#246891}
.runner-compare p{margin:0;color:#607f92;line-height:1.8;font-size:12px}
.runner-arrow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:29px;color:#4fa9d0;font-weight:900}
.runner-timeline{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
.runner-tl{position:relative;border-left:3px solid #81cbe9;padding:8px 12px 10px 15px;background:#f8fcff;border-radius:0 13px 13px 0}
.runner-tl small{font-weight:900;color:#4b98c3;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.05em}
.runner-tl b{display:block;margin:5px 0;color:#245e83;font-size:13px}
.runner-tl p{margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#688596}
.runner-note{background:#eff8fe;border-left:3px solid #6db9e2;color:#57788f;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:15px 18px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;margin-top:16px}
.runner-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.runner-links a{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;background:#1f80b6;color:#fff;border-radius:35px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;padding:12px 17px}
.runner-links a:hover{background:#17618a}
.runner-links .runner-link-secondary{background:#e9f6fe;color:#2679a7}
.runner-status{font-size:12px;color:#688496;margin:15px 0 0;line-height:1.9}
@media(max-width:840px){.runner-hero-copy{padding:35px 26px}.runner-body{padding:18px 25px 30px}.runner-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.runner-hero-image{min-height:245px}.runner-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.runner-facts{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:560px){.runner-body{padding:13px 18px 24px}.runner-hero h2{font-size:42px}.runner-hero h2 span{font-size:16px}.runner-cover-year{font-size:9px}.runner-cover-sub{font-size:9px}.runner-story,.runner-gallery,.runner-timeline,.runner-grid,.runner-compare{grid-template-columns:1fr}.runner-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.runner-arrow{transform:rotate(90deg);height:32px}.runner-feature-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}.runner-facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
/* END PROJECT 02 ADDITION */

body{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eff9ff,#ffffff);min-height:100vh}
.runner-standalone.runner-dialog{display:block!important;width:min(1100px,calc(100% - 34px));max-height:none;overflow:visible;padding:0;margin:25px auto 45px;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:0 18px 55px #184c6d22;border-radius:22px}
.runner-standalone .runner-hero{min-height:340px}
.runner-standalone .exit4-dialog-bar{top:0}
.runner-standalone .runner-status{padding-bottom:15px}
.runner-standalone-banner{margin:28px auto 0;max-width:1100px;padding:0 6px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;font-size:12px;color:#4c85a9;font-weight:850}
.runner-standalone-banner a{color:#287eb1;text-decoration:none;font-weight:900}
@media(max-width:560px){.runner-standalone.runner-dialog{width:calc(100% - 18px);margin:8px auto 20px}.runner-standalone-banner{margin-top:14px;padding:0 14px}}

/* PROJECT 02 / linked playable gameplay video - no EXIT-4 changes */
.runner-card-video-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;text-decoration:none;align-self:flex-start;margin-top:11px;padding:9px 14px;border:1px solid #8ccae9;border-radius:999px;background:#e4f5ff;color:#276f9d;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.4;transition:background .2s, color .2s}
.runner-card-video-link:hover{background:#287fb6;color:#fff}
.runner-video-hero-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;margin-top:18px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:100px;background:#287fb6;color:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;box-shadow:0 10px 24px #2c7eaf24}
.runner-video-hero-link:hover{background:#185f8d}

.runner-hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:18px}
.runner-hero-actions .runner-video-hero-link{margin-top:0}
.runner-pdf-hero-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:45px;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid #b4ddec;border-radius:100px;background:#fff;color:#2377ac;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;box-shadow:0 8px 19px #2c7eaf14}
.runner-pdf-hero-link:hover{background:#edf8ff}

.runner-video-showcase{margin:22px 48px 0;padding:24px;border:1px solid #d4eafb;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f3fbff,#ffffff);box-shadow:0 12px 28px #438bb80c}
.runner-video-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:15px}
.runner-video-heading .runner-video-eyebrow{color:#4695c1;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}
.runner-video-heading h3{color:#173f62;font-size:23px;margin:6px 0;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.045em}
.runner-video-heading p{font-size:12px;color:#658398;line-height:1.7;margin:0}
.runner-video-heading>a{flex-shrink:0;text-decoration:none;background:#e1f2fd;color:#2373a7;padding:11px 15px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}
.runner-video-heading>a:hover{background:#cde9fa}
.runner-video-screen{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;border-radius:15px;background:#173b53;box-shadow:0 9px 22px #25567126}
.runner-video-screen iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}
@media(max-width:840px){.runner-video-showcase{margin:15px 23px 0;padding:18px}}
@media(max-width:560px){.runner-video-showcase{margin:13px 16px 0;padding:13px}.runner-video-heading h3{font-size:20px}}
</style></head><body>
<div class="runner-standalone-banner"><span>YEJONG. / GAME DESIGN PORTFOLIO / PROJECT 02</span><a href="index.html#projects">← 전체 프로젝트</a></div>
<main class="runner-dialog runner-standalone"><div class="exit4-modal-shell">
<div class="exit4-dialog-bar"><span><span class="runner-bar-dot"></span> YEJONG. / PROJECT 02 / PERSONAL CASE STUDY</span><a class="exit4-close" href="index.html#projects" style="text-decoration:none" aria-label="홈페이지 프로젝트 목록으로 돌아가기">← <small>목록으로</small></a></div>
<div class="runner-hero">
<div class="runner-hero-copy">
<div class="runner-kicker"><i></i> UNITY · 2D RUNNER · SOLO PROJECT</div>
<h2 id="runner-dialog-title">오늘도 무사히<span>도망치는 귀갓길에 선택과 수집을 더하다</span></h2>
<p>시험 점수를 숨긴 아이의 귀갓길. 자동 달리기와 점프·슬라이드라는 간단한 조작을, 경로 판단·피버·보스 대응·가족의 기억으로 확장한 개인 게임 기획 및 개발 프로젝트입니다.</p>
<div class="runner-meta"><span>2026.08 — 진행 중</span><span>Unity / PC</span><span>개인 기획·개발</span><span>AI 활용</span></div><div class="runner-hero-actions"><a class="runner-video-hero-link" href="https://youtu.be/4WmyT-zsGJE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">▶ 전체 플레이 영상 보기 ↗</a><a class="runner-pdf-hero-link" href="오늘도무사히_기획포트폴리오(서예종).pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">기획서 PDF 보기 ↗</a></div>
</div>
<div class="runner-hero-image"><img alt="오늘도 무사히 프로젝트 타이틀 로고" src="data:image/png;base64," /><span class="runner-image-label">프로젝트 타이틀 로고</span></div>
</div>
<div class="runner-body">
<section class="runner-section" id="runner-overview">
<div class="runner-eyebrow">01 / OVERVIEW</div><h3>익숙한 귀갓길을 긴장감 있는 놀이로 바꾸다</h3>
<p class="runner-lead">달리는 아이, 뒤쫓는 부모님, 장애물과 보상을 선택하는 짧은 순간. 쉽게 시작하고도 반복할 이유가 남는 러너를 목표로 했습니다.</p>
<dl class="runner-facts"><div class="runner-fact"><dt>장르</dt><dd>2D 횡스크롤 러너</dd></div><div class="runner-fact"><dt>플랫폼·엔진</dt><dd>PC · Unity</dd></div><div class="runner-fact"><dt>제작 형태</dt><dd>1인 기획·제작 / AI 보조</dd></div><div class="runner-fact"><dt>현재 자료 범위</dt><dd>47쪽 기획 포트폴리오</dd></div></dl>
<div class="runner-story"><img alt="가족과 함께 귀가하는 메모리얼 일러스트" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,"/><p><strong>이야기의 출발</strong><br/>좋지 않은 시험 점수를 숨긴 아이가 집으로 향합니다. 처음에는 부모님을 피해야 하는 추격자로 느끼지만, 플레이 중 모은 기억 10화를 따라가며 가족을 다시 바라보게 됩니다. 긴장과 수집의 끝에 감정의 변화를 놓았습니다.</p></div>
<div class="runner-note">기획 질문 · 이동은 자동인데, 어떻게 플레이어마다 다른 판단과 경험이 생기게 할까?</div>
</section>
<section class="runner-section" id="runner-role">
<div class="runner-eyebrow">02 / MY ROLE</div><h3>규칙부터 콘텐츠와 화면까지 연결한 1인 프로젝트</h3>
<p class="runner-lead">게임 규칙과 콘텐츠 구성, 플레이 흐름 및 화면 구성을 설계하고, 구현된 플레이 화면을 기준으로 의도와 동작을 설명했습니다.</p>
<div class="runner-grid"><div class="runner-panel"><span class="runner-number">01 · PLANNING</span><strong>시스템·보상 설계</strong><p>분노와 회복, 소모 아이템, 재화·기억·보스 열쇠·의상의 역할을 나누고 판정 조건을 정의했습니다.</p></div><div class="runner-panel"><span class="runner-number">02 · EXPERIENCE</span><strong>콘텐츠·레벨 기획</strong><p>상·하단 경로, 예고→실행→착지 구간, 피버 4종과 보스 6종의 전투 차이를 설계했습니다.</p></div><div class="runner-panel"><span class="runner-number">03 · ITERATION</span><strong>플레이 흐름·화면 구성</strong><p>점수와 생존 상태를 구분하고, 상점·옷장·메모리얼을 준비·꾸미기·감상의 목적에 맞게 구성했습니다. 코드·이미지 제작에는 AI를 활용했습니다.</p></div></div>
</section>
<section class="runner-section" id="runner-systems">
<div class="runner-eyebrow">03 / CORE SYSTEMS</div><h3>생존의 선택과 여러 판의 수집을 연결했습니다</h3>
<p class="runner-lead">한 판에서는 장애물 회피와 분노 관리, 여러 판에서는 기억·의상·재화 수집이 플레이를 이어 줍니다.</p>
<div class="runner-flow"><div><b>자동 전진</b><small>달리기 시작</small></div><div><b>점프·슬라이드</b><small>위험 예고와 대응</small></div><div><b>경로·아이템 선택</b><small>보상과 생존 관리</small></div><div><b>피버·보스 도전</b><small>별도의 플레이 규칙</small></div><div><b>기억·의상 수집</b><small>다음 판 동기</small></div></div>
<div class="runner-feature-rows"><div class="runner-feature-row"><b>분노 / 추격</b><p>분노 60에서 엄마, 80에서 아빠가 추격에 참여하고 100에서 붙잡힙니다. 회복 아이템과 재개 티켓으로 만회할 기회를 주되, 후반에는 회복 간격을 늘려 안정적인 회피를 요구합니다.</p></div><div class="runner-feature-row"><b>경로 / 타이밍</b><p>점프·2단 점프와 슬라이드로 위험의 높이와 타이밍에 대응합니다. 장애물의 예고와 수집물의 위치를 읽고, 상단 보상과 하단 회피 사이에서 경로를 선택합니다.</p></div><div class="runner-feature-row"><b>장기 보상</b><p>코인은 소모품, 메모리 디스크는 기억 10화, 보스 열쇠는 전투 입장, 의상 부위는 수집과 외형 효과로 연결됩니다.</p></div></div>
</section>
<section class="runner-section" id="runner-content">
<div class="runner-eyebrow">04 / CONTENT &amp; LEVEL DESIGN</div><h3>같은 기본 조작을 서로 다른 과제로 확장</h3>
<p class="runner-lead">이동·회피를 완전히 바꾸기보다, 어떤 정보를 보고 언제 누르는지 달리해 한 판 안에 여러 리듬을 만들었습니다.</p>
<div class="runner-gallery"><figure><img alt="겨울 학교 구간 실제 플레이 화면" loading="lazy" src="data:image/webp;base64,